submission_format:
Return a JSON object with the same keys and nesting as the example below.

```json
{
  "artifacts": {
    "raw_logs": [
      "/workspace/output/log.cool"
    ]
  },
  "results": {
    "tg": 0.0
  }
}
```

Provide native thermo tables with Step (using the prescribed 1 fs timestep) or Time (elapsed fs), Temp (K), and Density (g/cm3). The evaluator uses cooling samples up to 370,000 fs with measured Temp <= 2600 K to fit Tg. Units: tg in K. List additional log files only if needed to supply those samples.
